meta { name: Current principal, type: http, seq: 1 }

get { url: {{adminBase}}/me, body: none, auth: none }

headers { Cookie: {{sessionCookie}} }

docs {
  Resolves the edge-validated Kratos session to a principal.

  Two shapes, discriminated on `kind`:

    author         → has tenantId and role
    platform-admin → both are null, by design; they have no tenant

  Set `sessionCookie` by logging in at http://localhost:3001 and copying the
  ory_kratos_session cookie, or drive the Kratos flow from this collection.

  A 403 here means the identity is valid but not provisioned as an author or
  platform admin — that is a real state, not a bug. See
  core-engine/docs/api-reference.md.
}
